      },
      "note": [
        "The statistics include graduates who have employment (employment or own business) both before and after HVE.\r\n\nIt is the graduates themselves who assess the level of qualification of their work tasks.\r\n\nThe statistics include graduates from  HVE programmes that ended the year before the follow-up year. Only graduates who are registered in Sweden during the follow-up year are included.",
        "The statistics are subject to uncertainty because not everyone responded to the survey. Therefore, a margin of error is always given. It is a range within which the true value is found with 95 percent certainty"
